飞牛在 x86_64 (ABI 64, x32 不提供) 和 i386 表里都把 802 号给了
sys_recvfile, 中间 470..801 为空, 因此 NR_syscalls 变成 803
(sys_call_table 803 项、x64_sys_call/ia32_sys_call 的 switch 有 0x322 分支)。

原型、struct recvfile_io_stats (uapi/linux/fs.h)、file_operations.recvfile
(位于 splice_read 与 splice_eof 之间) 和 generic_recvfile 声明已随
15010b68d 的头文件一起进树, 这里只补系统调用表。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_32.tbl | 1 +
 arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_64.tbl | 5 +++++
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_32.tbl b/arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_32.tbl
index 4877e16da..1e223220f 100644
--- a/arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_32.tbl
+++ b/arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_32.tbl
@@ -475,3 +475,4 @@
 467	i386	open_tree_attr		sys_open_tree_attr
 468	i386	file_getattr		sys_file_getattr
 469	i386	file_setattr		sys_file_setattr
+802	i386	recvfile		sys_recvfile
diff --git a/arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_64.tbl b/arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_64.tbl
index ced2a1dee..f1edb6c21 100644
--- a/arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_64.tbl
+++ b/arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_64.tbl
@@ -439,3 +439,8 @@
 547	x32	pwritev2		compat_sys_pwritev64v2
 # This is the end of the legacy x32 range.  Numbers 548 and above are
 # not special and are not to be used for x32-specific syscalls.
+
+#
+# fnOS private: socket -> file zero-copy receive (for Samba)
+#
+802	64	recvfile		sys_recvfile
